  "version": "0.16.0-alpha.4",
  "notes": "> **⚠️ Important notice for users on 0.14.0-alpha.9 – 0.14.0**: these versions have a bug that prevents automatic updates from completing. Please open `https://uniclipboard.app/download` in your browser, download the latest installer, and reinstall manually.\n\n## 0.16.0-alpha.4 - 2026-06-18\n\n### Features\n\n- Rename the mobile sync CLI command to `uniclip mobile` and make setup easier by automatically including detected network addresses in the QR code (#1099)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Keep the Debug mode restart dialog open with a waiting state while the app and background daemon restart (#1102)\n- Prevent repeated duplicate image captures on Linux when using VirtualBox shared clipboard (#1105)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n> **⚠️ 重要公告（0.14.0-alpha.9 ~ 0.14.0 用户）**：这些版本存在自动更新缺陷，点击安装后无法完成更新。请在浏览器中打开 `https://uniclipboard.app/download`，手动下载最新安装包覆盖安装。\n\n## 0.16.0-alpha.4 - 2026-06-18\n\n### Features\n\n- 将移动端同步 CLI 命令改名为 `uniclip mobile`，并通过在二维码中自动包含检测到的网络地址来简化 setup 流程 (#1099)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 开启 Debug 模式时，重启应用与后台 daemon 期间会保留等待中的重启对话框 (#1102)\n- 修复在 Linux 使用 VirtualBox 共享剪贴板时图片可能被反复重复捕获的问题 (#1105)",
